>> title: Spring Asparagus Risotto
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, vegetarian
>> time: 40 minutes

Warm @vegetable stock{1.2%l} in a #saucepan{} and keep it at a gentle simmer.

Soften @onion{1} and @garlic{2%cloves}, finely chopped, in @butter{30%g} in a wide #pan{} for ~{6%minutes}.

Stir in @risotto rice{320%g} and toast for a minute, then pour in @white wine{125%ml} and let it bubble away.

Add the stock a ladle at a time, stirring, for ~{18%minutes}.

Slice @asparagus{400%g} and stir in for the last ~{5%minutes}, then finish with @parmesan{60%g}, @lemon{1} zest and @parsley{2%tbsp}.
